# Graphify & discovery

**Canonical rule:** `codebase-discovery.mdc` (Understand Anything + graphify + fallback).

## Graphify quick path

1. `graphify update . --wiki` (when CLI available)
2. Read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md`
3. `graphify query` for targeted questions
4. `devkit://graphify-workflow`

After edits: `graphify update .`
